Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:01.76,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么{\fs78}39{\fs68}岁的德约
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:04.39,TL,,0,0,0,,连续{\fs78}21{\fs68}个赛季都能夺冠？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:10.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But it is a seventh Beijing title for Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是德约科维奇的第七个北京冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.72,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:14.87,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}6{\fs68}日 北京 {\fs78}39{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.96,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}第一盘{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 第二盘刚开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:18.33,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}德米纳尔退了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.47,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}这是第{\fs78}102{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.01,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}赛季还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:24.76,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}到目前 这一年一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.76,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2006{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}19{\fs68}岁 阿默斯福特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:31.34,TL,,0,0,0,,对面马苏 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.79,TL,,0,0,0,,这一抱很轻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:35.95,TL,,0,0,0,,谁也没当成往后每年一座的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:38.86,TL,,0,0,0,,他把冠军收下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:41.13,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 两个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.88,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2007{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.15,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对面换成费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:48.72,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘都是{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 中间{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:49.97,TL,,0,0,0,,那股锐气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:52.52,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次顶到当时的世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.54,0:00:59.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's done it, what a way to do so.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下了 就这么拿下的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:01.00,TL,,0,0,0,,这座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.71,TL,,0,0,0,,从费德勒手里过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.71,0:01:04.95,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}5{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:08.60,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2008{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:11.28,TL,,0,0,0,,年终总决赛 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:13.36,TL,,0,0,0,,对面 达维登科
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:17.18,TL,,0,0,0,,他把奖杯举起来 爆发 还要再等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:19.44,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}4{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:22.80,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2009{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.83,TL,,0,0,0,,巴塞尔 又是费德勒 还是他的主场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:28.15,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分过去 才是{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:29.61,TL,,0,0,0,,和费德勒的账
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:30.94,TL,,0,0,0,,从这儿变密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:33.17,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}5{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.43,0:01:38.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2010{\fs68}年 北京 赛点 对面费雷尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:41.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}16{\fs68}年后 同一座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:42.73,TL,,0,0,0,,他还在拿冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:45.00,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 两个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:47.16,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2011{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.53,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网冠军点 对面穆雷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:51.29,TL,,0,0,0,,这一冠只是开头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:52.95,TL,,0,0,0,,开季{\fs78}41{\fs68}连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:54.81,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次登上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:57.14,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}10{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.53,0:02:03.49,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2012{\fs68}年 {\fs78}5{\fs68}盘 对面 纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:04.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2013{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.44,TL,,0,0,0,,又是澳网决赛 又是穆雷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:09.04,TL,,0,0,0,,第六座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:10.27,TL,,0,0,0,,这种决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:11.85,TL,,0,0,0,,开始变成习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.85,0:02:14.03,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}7{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2014{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:19.75,TL,,0,0,0,,先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:21.74,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七里咬住费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.90,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}7{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:29.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Congratulations to Djokovic as he returns to the winner's circle once more.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N恭喜德约科维奇 他又拿到冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.79,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2015{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:33.17,TL,,0,0,0,,年终总决赛 又是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:34.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:36.58,TL,,0,0,0,,他已经站在那儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:39.01,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}11{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:41.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:44.24,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}座大满贯 到这一年凑齐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.24,0:02:46.42,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}7{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:55.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ladies and gentlemen, your Qatar ExxonMobil Open 2017 champion, Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡塔尔公开赛冠军 德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:59.44,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年 右肘 温网对伯蒂奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:01.66,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}他退了 这个赛季停了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:03.42,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}他说 不是肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.31,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}是这只肘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:06.82,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}断断续续已经烦了我一年半
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:09.61,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}多哈和伊斯特本 都在这之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:11.88,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}这一年 两个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:13.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:15.72,TL,,0,0,0,,手术之后的温网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.98,TL,,0,0,0,,对面安德森 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:19.69,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分是冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:21.97,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}4{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:26.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:28.60,TL,,0,0,0,,温网决赛 费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:31.62,TL,,0,0,0,,第五盘{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} 两个赛点都没兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:32.47,TL,,0,0,0,,他后来说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:35.79,TL,,0,0,0,,落后两个赛点还能翻回来 很不真实
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:38.88,TL,,0,0,0,,从赛点里抢回来的 比轻松拿下的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:40.51,TL,,0,0,0,,更能说明一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:42.73,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}5{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:44.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.51,0:03:47.07,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网决赛 决胜盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:48.29,TL,,0,0,0,,对面蒂姆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:50.66,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分过去 才是{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:52.27,TL,,0,0,0,,他已经不缺冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:53.79,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分还是不放
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:56.07,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}4{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:02.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:05.01,TL,,0,0,0,,法网的冠军杯 又在他手里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:06.30,TL,,0,0,0,,纳达尔还在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.47,TL,,0,0,0,,他也还在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.71,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}5{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:21.05,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:22.30,TL,,0,0,0,,温网赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.80,TL,,0,0,0,,对面克耶高斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.05,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}35{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.05,0:04:26.54,TL,,0,0,0,,大满贯还没停
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:28.76,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}5{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:30.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.89,TL,,0,0,0,,年终总决赛 第七座
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:34.55,TL,,0,0,0,,费德勒已经退役
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:35.82,TL,,0,0,0,,这座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:37.72,TL,,0,0,0,,他一年一年还在拿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.90,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 {\fs78}7{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:47.30,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.47,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}37{\fs68}岁对{\fs78}21{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:57.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}In his fifth Olympic Games, Novak Djokovic finally gets what he wanted.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第五次奥运 他终于得到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:04:59.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Olympic gold.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥运金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:01.36,TL,,0,0,0,,他说 我终于做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:04.74,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 一个冠军 巴黎奥运金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:09.38,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年 雅典 {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:10.44,TL,,0,0,0,,再拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:11.75,TL,,0,0,0,,对面穆塞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:14.01,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 两个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:17.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fabulous match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场球太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:20.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The first time in nine meetings.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N九次交手 这是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.49,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}为什么{\fs78}39{\fs68}岁还能赢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:24.87,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}不是因为他不再输 上海
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:27.84,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}胡尔卡奇{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}淘汰了他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:29.95,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}他说 尤其是在北京
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:31.97,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}一个我从没输过的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:32.88,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}但我也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:35.30,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}现在的现实已经不太一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:36.71,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}连续{\fs78}21{\fs68}个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.48,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}每年都有一座冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:39.92,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}靠的不是不败
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:43.02,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}下一个赛季 你等他再添一座吗？
